      "note": "同一把 Key 可走 Responses、Chat Completions 和 Anthropic 格式。Responses 目前只支持 deepseek-flash，服务端不保存对话；思考模式下调用工具时，必须把推理内容回传。",
      "routes": [
        { "id": "responses", "label": "Responses", "protocol": "openai-responses", "baseUrl": "https://api.deepseek.com", "authMode": "bearer",
          "dialect": { "outputCap": "max_output_tokens", "store": false },
          "listModels": true, "balancePath": "/user/balance" },
        { "id": "chat", "label": "Chat Completions", "protocol": "openai-chat-completions", "baseUrl": "https://api.deepseek.com", "authMode": "bearer",
          "dialect": { "outputCap": "max_tokens", "streamUsage": true, "thinkingParam": "thinking-type", "reasoningReplay": "with-tools" },
